PROJECT: Movement Labs

## System Architecture

- Arsitektur modular blockchain stack berbasis MoveVM dengan lapisan eksekusi (MoveVM/MEVM), lapisan settlement (Ethereum L1), dan lapisan data availability modular (Celestia, Avail, EigenDA direncanakan) (HIGH) [Movement Labs Blog, https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-movement-labs-building-the-move-based-modular-blockchain-stack/]
- M1 merupakan Layer 2 rollup pada Ethereum yang menggunakan MoveVM untuk eksekusi transaksi dan Ethereum untuk finality serta data availability (HIGH) [Movement Labs Blog, https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-movement-labs-building-the-move-based-modular-blockchain-stack/]
- Movement Network dirancang sebagai jaringan interconnected Move chains untuk interoperabilitas antar rollup dan app-chain berbasis Movement SDK (HIGH) [Movement Labs Blog, https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-movement-labs-building-the-move-based-modular-blockchain-stack/]
- MEVM (Move-EVM compatibility layer) memungkinkan kontrak Solidity berjalan di MoveVM tanpa modifikasi melalui transpilasi bytecode EVM ke Move bytecode (HIGH) [Movement Labs Blog, https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-the-mevm-testnet-parthenon/]
- Arsitektur mengadopsi pendekatan modular: execution layer (MoveVM), settlement layer (Ethereum), DA layer (pluggable: Celestia/Avail/EigenDA), dan consensus layer (sequencer-based dengan opsi decentralized sequencing) (MEDIUM) [Movement Labs Docs, https://docs.movementlabs.xyz/]

## Core Components

- MoveVM: Virtual machine eksekusi berbasis Move language dengan dukungan parallel execution dan formal verification; komponen inti untuk eksekusi transaksi di M1 dan Movement Network (HIGH) [Movement Labs Website Products, https://movementlabs.xyz/products]
- MEVM: Kompatibilitas layer Move-EVM yang menerjemahkan bytecode EVM ke Move bytecode, memungkinkan deployment kontrak Solidity tanpa perubahan (HIGH) [Movement Labs Blog, https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-the-mevm-testnet-parthenon/]
- Movement SDK: Framework modular untuk membangun Move-based rollup dan app-chain; menyediakan tooling, VM integration, dan infrastruktur rollup (HIGH) [Movement Labs Website Products, https://movementlabs.xyz/products]
- M1 Sequencer: Entitas yang mengurutkan transaksi untuk M1 L2; saat testnet Parthenon dioperasikan oleh Movement Labs (centralized sequencer) (MEDIUM) [Movement Labs Blog, https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-the-mevm-testnet-parthenon/]
- Ethereum Settlement Contracts: Kontrak pintar di Ethereum L1 untuk verifikasi state root, dispute resolution (jika menggunakan fraud proof), dan finality (MEDIUM) [Movement Labs Docs, https://docs.movementlabs.xyz/]
- DA Layer Adapters: Modul integrasi untuk Celestia, Avail, dan EigenDA guna mempublikasikan data transaksi ke lapisan DA terpisah (MEDIUM) [Movement Labs Blog, https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-movement-labs-building-the-move-based-modular-blockchain-stack/]
- Movement Network Coordinator: Komponen yang direncanakan untuk koordinasi cross-chain messaging dan interoperabilitas antar Move chains (MEDIUM) [Movement Labs Blog, https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-movement-labs-building-the-move-based-modular-blockchain-stack/]
- Parthenon Testnet Explorer: Block explorer untuk visualisasi blok, transaksi, dan state MEVM testnet di explorer.testnet.movementlabs.xyz (HIGH) [Testnet Explorer, https://explorer.testnet.movementlabs.xyz/]
- Movement SDK CLI/Tooling: Developer toolchain untuk kompilasi Move, deployment, testing, dan debugging (HIGH) [Movement Labs GitHub, https://github.com/movementlabsxyz]

## Consensus Mechanism

- M1 menggunakan centralized sequencer pada tahap testnet (Parthenon) dengan rencana transisi ke decentralized sequencer set (MEDIUM) [Movement Labs Blog, https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-the-mevm-testnet-parthenon/]
- Finality dan keamanan ekonomis diwarisi dari Ethereum L1 melalui settlement contracts (HIGH) [Movement Labs Blog, https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-movement-labs-building-the-move-based-modular-blockchain-stack/]
- Tidak ada consensus mechanism native (seperti PoS/PoA) untuk Movement Network secara mandiri; bergantung pada L1 settlement dan DA layer yang dipilih (MEDIUM) [Movement Labs Docs, https://docs.movementlabs.xyz/]
- Rincian mekanisme fraud proof atau validity proof untuk state transition belum dipublikasikan secara detail di dokumentasi resmi (LOW) [Movement Labs Docs, https://docs.movementlabs.xyz/]

## Execution Environment

- MoveVM: Custom Move virtual machine dengan dukungan parallel execution berbasis dependency graph (seperti Block-STM) dan formal verification via Move Prover (HIGH) [Movement Labs Website Products, https://movementlabs.xyz/products]
- MEVM: EVM compatibility layer yang mengeksekusi bytecode EVM dengan mentranslasikannya ke Move bytecode; mendukung precompiles dan Solidity tooling standard (Hardhat, Foundry) (HIGH) [Movement Labs Blog, https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-the-mevm-testnet-parthenon/]
- Lingkungan eksekusi mendukung dua mode: native Move smart contracts (Move bytecode) dan Solidity contracts via MEVM (HIGH) [Movement Labs Docs, https://docs.movementlabs.xyz/]

## Programming Languages

- Move: Bahasa utama untuk smart contract native di MoveVM (HIGH) [Movement Labs Website Products, https://movementlabs.xyz/products]
- Rust: Bahasa implementasi MoveVM, MEVM, Movement SDK, dan infrastruktur node (HIGH) [Movement Labs GitHub, https://github.com/movementlabsxyz]
- Solidity: Bahasa untuk kontrak yang di-deploy via MEVM (kompatibilitas EVM) (HIGH) [Movement Labs Blog, https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-the-mevm-testnet-parthenon/]
- TypeScript/JavaScript: SDK client-side, tooling CLI, dan testing framework (MEDIUM) [Movement Labs GitHub, https://github.com/movementlabsxyz]

## Development Framework

- Movement SDK: Framework modular untuk membangun rollup/app-chain; menyediakan abstraksi untuk VM, DA, settlement, dan sequencing (HIGH) [Movement Labs Website Products, https://movementlabs.xyz/products]
- Move Prover: Formal verification tool untuk Move smart contracts (terintegrasi dari Move language toolchain) (HIGH) [Movement Labs Docs, https://docs.movementlabs.xyz/]
- MEVM Compiler/Transpiler: Toolchain untuk kompilasi Solidity -> EVM bytecode -> Move bytecode (HIGH) [Movement Labs Blog, https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-the-mevm-testnet-parthenon/]
- Hardhat/Foundry Support: Kompatibilitas dengan framework pengembangan Ethereum standar via MEVM (HIGH) [Movement Labs Blog, https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-the-mevm-testnet-parthenon/]
- Movement CLI: Command-line interface untuk project scaffolding, deployment, dan interaksi dengan testnet/mainnet (MEDIUM) [Movement Labs GitHub, https://github.com/movementlabsxyz]

## Security Model

- Keamanan eksekusi: MoveVM menyediakan resource-oriented programming, formal verification (Move Prover), dan parallel execution yang aman secara deterministik (HIGH) [Movement Labs Website Products, https://movementlabs.xyz/products]
- Keamanan settlement: Bergantung pada Ethereum L1 validator set untuk finality dan ketersediaan data (jika menggunakan Ethereum DA) (HIGH) [Movement Labs Blog, https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-movement-labs-building-the-move-based-modular-blockchain-stack/]
- Keamanan DA: Pluggable DA layer (Celestia/Avail/EigenDA) dengan security model masing-masing (DAS, sampling, eigenlayer restaking) (MEDIUM) [Movement Labs Blog, https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-movement-labs-building-the-move-based-modular-blockchain-stack/]
- Sequencer trust assumption: Pada testnet Parthenon, sequencer terpusat dioperasikan Movement Labs; rencana decentralized sequencer set untuk mainnet (MEDIUM) [Movement Labs Blog, https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-the-mevm-testnet-parthenon/]
- Fraud proof / Validity proof: Detail mekanisme bukti (fraud proof optimistic rollup atau validity proof ZK) belum dipublikasikan resmi (LOW) [Movement Labs Docs, https://docs.movementlabs.xyz/]
- Upgradeability: Kontrol upgrade protokol (Movement SDK, MoveVM, MEVM) saat ini di tangan Movement Labs Inc.; rencana governance on-chain belum diumumkan (MEDIUM) [Movement Labs Blog, https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-movement-labs-building-the-move-based-modular-blockchain-stack/]

## Audit History

- Tidak ditemukan laporan audit keamanan publik untuk MoveVM, MEVM, Movement SDK, atau M1 settlement contracts per cut-off knowledge (LOW) [Movement Labs Blog, https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/; Movement Labs GitHub, https://github.com/movementlabsxyz; Movement Labs Docs, https://docs.movementlabs.xyz/]
- Status audit: belum diumumkan resmi (LOW) [Movement Labs Discord FAQ, https://discord.gg/movementlabs]

## Technical Upgrade History

- 2024-07-30: Peluncuran Parthenon Testnet (MEVM Testnet v1) — testnet publik pertama untuk MoveVM, MEVM, dan Movement SDK tooling (HIGH) [Movement Labs Blog, https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-the-mevm-testnet-parthenon/]
- 2024 (tanggal tidak spesifik): Rilis Movement SDK v0.x (pre-release) di GitHub untuk developer early access (MEDIUM) [Movement Labs GitHub, https://github.com/movementlabsxyz]
- Tidak ada upgrade mainnet karena mainnet belum diluncurkan (HIGH) [Movement Labs Blog, https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/]

## Current Technical Stack

- Rust: Implementasi core MoveVM, MEVM, Movement SDK, node software (HIGH) [Movement Labs GitHub, https://github.com/movementlabsxyz]
- Move: Smart contract language dan bytecode format (HIGH) [Movement Labs Website Products, https://movementlabs.xyz/products]
- Solidity: Bahasa kontrak untuk kompatibilitas EVM via MEVM (HIGH) [Movement Labs Blog, https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-the-mevm-testnet-parthenon/]
- Docker: Containerization untuk node deployment dan testnet infrastructure (MEDIUM) [Movement Labs GitHub, https://github.com/movementlabsxyz]
- Kubernetes: Orkestrasi infrastructure testnet (Parthenon) dan developer tooling (MEDIUM) [Movement Labs GitHub, https://github.com/movementlabsxyz]
- Ethereum (Geth/Erigon): L1 settlement layer interaction (MEDIUM) [Movement Labs Docs, https://docs.movementlabs.xyz/]
- Celestia / Avail / EigenDA: Planned DA layer integrations (SDK adapters in development) (MEDIUM) [Movement Labs Blog, https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-movement-labs-building-the-move-based-modular-blockchain-stack/]
- TypeScript/JavaScript: SDK client, CLI, testing frameworks (Hardhat/Foundry plugins) (MEDIUM) [Movement Labs GitHub, https://github.com/movementlabsxyz]
- GitHub Actions: CI/CD pipeline untuk testing dan release (MEDIUM) [Movement Labs GitHub, https://github.com/movementlabsxyz]

## Known Technical Limitations

- Centralized sequencer pada testnet Parthenon (single point of failure untuk urutan transaksi) (HIGH) [Movement Labs Blog, https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-the-mevm-testnet-parthenon/]
- MEVM kompatibilitas EVM belum 100%: precompiles tertentu, opcode spesifik, dan gas semantics mungkin berbeda dari Ethereum mainnet (MEDIUM) [Movement Labs Blog, https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-the-mevm-testnet-parthenon/]
- Parallel execution MoveVM bergantung pada analisis dependensi transaksi; kontensi tinggi pada state yang sama mengurangi throughput paralel (MEDIUM) [Movement Labs Docs, https://docs.movementlabs.xyz/]
- Tidak ada fraud proof / validity proof system yang live atau terdokumentasi detail untuk M1 (LOW) [Movement Labs Docs, https://docs.movementlabs.xyz/]
- DA layer integrations (Celestia, Avail, EigenDA) masih di tahap planned/roadmap; belum live di testnet Parthenon (MEDIUM) [Movement Labs Blog, https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-movement-labs-building-the-move-based-modular-blockchain-stack/]
- Movement Network cross-chain messaging protocol belum diimplementasikan atau terdokumentasi secara teknis (LOW) [Movement Labs Blog, https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-movement-labs-building-the-move-based-modular-blockchain-stack/]
- Upgradeability dan governance mechanism untuk protokol inti belum didefinisikan secara on-chain (MEDIUM) [Movement Labs Blog, https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-movement-labs-building-the-move-based-modular-blockchain-stack/]

