## Summary

Architecture: Modular Move-based blockchain stack (Execution: MoveVM/MEVM, Settlement: Ethereum L1, DA: Pluggable Celestia/Avail/EigenDA, Sequencing: Centralized testnet -> Planned decentralized)
Core Components: MoveVM, MEVM, Movement SDK, M1 Sequencer, Ethereum Settlement Contracts, DA Layer Adapters, Movement Network Coordinator, Testnet Explorer, SDK Tooling
Audit Count: 0 (tidak ada audit publik yang diverifikasi)
Major Upgrade Count: 1 (Parthenon Testnet launch 2024-07-30)

